  return <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: "<h1 id=\"http-api\">HTTP API</h1>\n<p>The server exposes a JSON API on <code>http://127.0.0.1:8000</code> by default. This surface \u2014\ntogether with the <code>glaux</code> CLI \u2014 is what Glaux's <a href=\"https://semver.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">semantic version</a>\npromise covers.</p>\n<p>Set <code>GLAUX_API_SECRET</code> to require signed requests. Most endpoints require an\nauthenticated session; <code>/api/health</code> is public.</p>\n<h2 id=\"running-tasks\">Running tasks</h2>\n<h3 id=\"post-apitask\"><code>POST /api/task</code></h3>\n<p>Run a directive and wait for the result.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -X POST localhost:8000/api/task \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{&quot;directive&quot;: &quot;explain bloom filters&quot;}'\n</code></pre>\n<p>Returns <code>success</code>, <code>final</code>, <code>cost</code>, <code>model</code>, <code>plan</code>, <code>steps</code>, <code>new_blocks</code>,\n<code>verification</code>, <code>session_id</code>. A cache hit additionally returns <code>cached: true</code>,\n<code>similarity</code>, and <code>matched_directive</code>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"post-apitaskstream\"><code>POST /api/task/stream</code></h3>\n<p>Same, as Server-Sent Events: a <code>start</code> event, live <code>block</code> events (each signed step),\n<code>token</code> deltas as the answer streams, then <code>done</code> with the full result.</p>\n<h3 id=\"post-apitaskstop\"><code>POST /api/task/stop</code></h3>\n<p>Cancel the running task for the current user.</p>\n<h2 id=\"trust\">Trust</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Endpoint</th>\n<th>Does</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/health</code></td>\n<td>Status, model, safety, ledger size, capabilities <em>(public)</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/ledger</code></td>\n<td>Blocks + chain verification</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/agents</code></td>\n<td>Agent identities and public keys</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/metrics</code></td>\n<td>Task, token, and cost counters</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"skills\">Skills</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Endpoint</th>\n<th>Does</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/skills[?status=]</code></td>\n<td>List skills</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POST /api/skills/synthesize</code></td>\n<td>Synthesize a skill (<code>{task}</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POST /api/skills/{id}/approve</code> \u00b7 <code>/reject</code></td>\n<td>Gated-mode approval</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POST /api/skills/{id}/use</code></td>\n<td>Record a use (<code>{success}</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"capabilities\">Capabilities</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Endpoint</th>\n<th>Does</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET/POST /api/fs</code></td>\n<td>Jailed workspace: state, files, tools; <code>{enabled}</code> toggles</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET/POST /api/playbooks</code> \u00b7 <code>DELETE /api/playbooks/{slug}</code></td>\n<td>Authored playbooks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POST /api/playbooks/enabled</code></td>\n<td>Expose playbooks to the swarm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET/POST /api/subagents</code> \u00b7 <code>DELETE /api/subagents/{slug}</code></td>\n<td>Custom specialists</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET/POST/DELETE /api/cache</code></td>\n<td>Semantic answer cache: stats, toggle, clear</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"self-evolving-harness\">Self-evolving harness</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Endpoint</th>\n<th>Does</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/evolution</code></td>\n<td>Accuracy, learned config, pinned tools, retired roles, log</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POST /api/evolution/evolve</code></td>\n<td>Run every operator (each independently gated)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POST /api/evolution/revert</code></td>\n<td>Roll back the last change</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POST /api/evolution/auto</code></td>\n<td><code>{enabled, every}</code> cadence</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POST /api/evolution/unpin/{skill_id}</code></td>\n<td>Un-promote a permanent tool</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POST /api/evolution/unretire/{role}</code></td>\n<td>Restore a retired specialist</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"controls\">Controls</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Endpoint</th>\n<th>Does</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET/POST /api/safety</code></td>\n<td>Kill switch: <code>live</code> \u00b7 <code>dry_run</code> \u00b7 <code>halted</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET/POST /api/approval</code></td>\n<td><code>auto</code> \u00b7 <code>gated</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET/POST /api/llm</code></td>\n<td>Show or switch the model backend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/memory/{layer}</code> \u00b7 <code>POST</code></td>\n<td>Browse or add memory</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GET /api/workspace</code></td>\n<td>Projects, sessions, personas, recipes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POST /api/mcp/call</code></td>\n<td>Call an MCP tool (<code>{tool, args}</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"errors\">Errors</h2>\n<p>Standard HTTP codes with a JSON <code>{\"detail\": \"...\"}</code> body: <code>400</code> invalid input, <code>401</code>\nnot signed in, <code>403</code> admin required, <code>404</code> unknown resource, <code>413</code> directive too long,\n<code>502</code> the model backend failed.</p>" }} />;
